{
  "uid": "intellihire-overview",
  "title": "IntelliHire / Overview",
  "description": "Golden-signal dashboard for the IntelliHire FastAPI backend. All queries use the metrics actually exposed at /metrics by prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator 8.1.0 with default settings: http_requests_total{method,status,handler} (status grouped as 2xx/3xx/4xx/5xx), http_request_duration_highr_seconds (label-free histogram for quantiles), http_request_duration_seconds{method,handler}, http_request_size_bytes{handler}, http_response_size_bytes{handler}. Queue depth and auth-failure counters do not exist yet - see the text panel and observability/ALERTING.md.",
  "tags": [
    "intellihire"
  ],
  "style": "dark",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Data source",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Alerting guide",
      "url": "https://[COMPANY-wiki]/observability/ALERTING.md",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "App up (scrape of /metrics)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"intellihire-app\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx ratio (5m)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"intellihire-app\",status=\"5xx\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"intellihire-app\"}[5m])), 0.01)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by status class",
      "description": "http_requests_total carries grouped status labels (2xx/3xx/4xx/5xx) and the route template as handler.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"intellihire-app\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "5xx"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency p50 / p95 / p99",
      "description": "Quantiles from the label-free high-resolution histogram http_request_duration_highr_seconds (buckets 0.01s to 60s). Proposed SLO: p95 < 1s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_highr_seconds_bucket{job=\"intellihire-app\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_highr_seconds_bucket{job=\"intellihire-app\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_highr_seconds_bucket{job=\"intellihire-app\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5xx responses per second",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"intellihire-app\",status=\"5xx\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": false,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Login failures (4xx on /api/auth/login)",
      "description": "PROXY metric: 400 (missing credentials), 401 (invalid credentials) and 429 (slowapi 5/minute limit) are all grouped into status=4xx. A dedicated auth-failure counter does not exist yet - see observability/ALERTING.md.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"intellihire-app\",handler=\"/api/auth/login\",status=\"4xx\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "login 4xx/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "/api/health 503s (Postgres down signal)",
      "description": "GET /api/health returns 503 only when the live query against the users table fails. Any nonzero value here means the database is unreachable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"intellihire-app\",handler=\"/api/health\",status=\"5xx\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "health 5xx/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Top 10 handlers by request rate",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (handler) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"intellihire-app\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{handler}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Queue depth - NOT YET INSTRUMENTED",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "There is **no Prometheus gauge** for queue depth yet.\n\n`BackgroundGradingQueue` (server_py/app/queue_manager.py) keeps work in Redis lists `grading-queue` and `interview-queue`, dead-letters into `grading-dlq` / `interview-dlq`, and falls back to a local `grading_queue.json` file when Redis is unavailable - none of it is exported to /metrics.\n\n**TODO:** add an app gauge, e.g. `intellihire_queue_depth{queue=...}`, then a panel plotting `intellihire_queue_depth{queue=\"grading-queue\"}` and an alert at >50 for 15m (see the commented rule in observability/alert_rules.yml).\n\nInterim check: `redis-cli LLEN grading-queue` (expect ~0; DLQ non-empty means permanently failed grading)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
